{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The requested action requires verifying after mutation that every selected song is liked, but none of the available public Spotify read responses exposes liked status. spotify.like_song only returns a message, so its effect cannot be verified through a public read API as required.","missing_public_schema_fields":["A public Spotify read response field indicating whether a song is liked (for example, is_liked), available when re-querying the affected song IDs after spotify."] ,"task_id":"ccb4494_2","task_family":"ccb4494","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"No compliant executable mutation plan can be produced until the public schema supports post-mutation verification of liked status.","steps":[]}